# `T-4` — copied into the project copy by `verify-ui-page.mjs` and run once at `--evidence full`
# before the page suite, so `report.tflw` has a failing browser test whose trace was kept. It fails on
# purpose: the storefront never shows this sentence. Never run by the ordinary suite — it lives under
# `tests/.tflw-ui/`, a dot-directory, and the copy puts it under another one.

test "the storefront is searched for a word it never shows"
  open "/"
  expect text "a sentence this storefront never shows" is visible
